{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1790443976422,"sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","part":{"id":"prt_0dec6f6cf001d35JzQX6Ha9ttK","messageID":"msg_0dec6b26e001bl80CTCOmuPn8z","sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1790443976422,"sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","part":{"id":"prt_0dec6f6d4001cO1VqgwgSckG31","messageID":"msg_0dec6b26e001bl80CTCOmuPn8z","sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","type":"text","text":"The quest works and `collected` starts at 0. The projectile node was missing because `_ready` (which runs before my first frame) likely freed it as off-screen. Let me test with a runtime-spawned projectile instead.","time":{"start":1790443976404,"end":1790443976409},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_6f0990cafffa48989817c6c3484c690a_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790443976460,"sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_21_5fc16357","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/test_verify.gd","content":"extends SceneTree\n\nvar _done := false\n\nfunc _initialize():\n\tvar main = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(main)\n\nfunc _process(_dt) -> bool:\n\tif _done:\n\t\treturn false\n\t_done = true\n\n\tvar main = root.get_node(\"Main\")\n\tvar qm = root.get_node(\"QuestManager\")\n\tvar enemy = main.get_node(\"Enemy\")\n\n\t# Spawn a projectile that overlaps the enemy (simulate a hit).\n\tvar proj = load(\"res://scenes/projectile.tscn\").instantiate()\n\tmain.add_child(proj)\n\tproj.position = enemy.position\n\n\tprint(\"STEP BEFORE: \", qm.get_current_step(\"shoot_em_up\", true))\n\tproj._on_area_entered(enemy)\n\tprint(\"STEP AFTER HIT: \", qm.get_current_step(\"shoot_em_up\", true))\n\tprint(\"HIT QUEUED FOR DELETION: \", proj.is_queued_for_deletion())\n\n\t# Test off-screen removal with a fresh node.\n\tvar proj2 = load(\"res://scenes/projectile.tscn\").instantiate()\n\tmain.add_child(proj2)\n\tproj2.position = Vector2(320, -60)\n\tproj2._physics_process(0.0)\n\tprint(\"OFFSCREEN QUEUED: \", proj2.is_queued_for_deletion())\n\n\tquit()\n\treturn true\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/test_verify.gd","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"workspace/test_verify.gd","time":{"start":1790443976418,"end":1790443976439}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_21_5fc16357"}},"id":"prt_0dec6f6db001USa92qzbRcNUc2","sessionID":"ses_f213b1b20ffebbHhMDFsTGo0qE","messageID":"msg_0dec6b26e001bl80CTCOmuPn8z"}}
